{"title":"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Josanna's test scores to date are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e8e748de674bda3176ac72ea05fb2864b3cd76a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90, 80, 70, 60,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3a66ed6edf9c931ffceb20bd11cd1acdddc94ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> Her goal is to raise her test average at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points with her next test. What is the minimum test score she would need to accomplish this goal?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1ddcb04e7e637d874013f2413037c10e71f59dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 80 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 82 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 85 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 90 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 95$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Take the average of her current test scores, which is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/5/c1521cab2e19aee7a6ad80fb78c54c4757fb4bf8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{90+80+70+60+85}{5} = \\frac{385}{5} = 77\\]\" width=\"279\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>This means that she wants her test average after the sixth test to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/64208b8141947233195b9c41cedc8ca7a25317b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the score that Josanna receives on her sixth test. Thus, our equation is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c6e1f7450052953bc25a0006ad917b7eb71b0c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{90+80+70+60+85+x}{6} = 80\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/8916fc02a40bbe5cdfa286489582de6ede8e4e5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[385+x = 480\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50c77746db4141356460dd69fbc15a713e186852.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\boxed{95 \\textbf{(E)}}\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B\">2011 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Prob